// REQUIRES: long
// P03.26: long chains of selectors, calls, indexes, mixes of them, method
// calls and chains that start at a package name, 150 functions each at the
// depth the parser accepts: near-linear time (a cost per link that grows with
// the chain, or with the chains before it, would not finish in time). The
// links of a long chain are evaluated in a loop (Checker::prepareChain).
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-chains.py %gopp %t.d many-sel,call,idx
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-chains.py %gopp %t.d many-mix,method
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-chains.py %gopp %t.d many-qual
